              "text": "le crime — \"the crime; the murder\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Ce crime a choqué toute la ville. This crime shocked the whole town."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "In French, un crime is a serious offence, often a murder."
            }
